# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository.
#
# Before this existed, HEAD held a mix — 15 files CRLF, 44 LF — because files
# arrived from different editors and nothing reconciled them. The cost isn't
# aesthetic: running Prettier across `src` rewrote the endings of files it had no
# other reason to touch, producing whitespace-only diffs on a dozen components
# and burying the handful of real edits among them. Committing this is a one-time
# normalisation; after that a formatter can only change what it means to change.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, so git never inspects or rewrites their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
